    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tocamunos Akuj ka Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kedau Daudi akiboikin kai keŋ, tema Daudi neni a Nasan a ekadwaran, “Ayai ayoŋ ne, eboi alokai a ŋina edukitoe a ŋakito a Cedar, nai eyai Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ke Ekapolon loeema.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Nasan neni a Daudi, “Kitiya daadaŋ ŋuna itami iyoŋ akitiyakin, anerae irukito iyoŋ kaapei ka Akuj.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Ekapolon kirwor neni a Nasan akoloŋit ŋin nakwaare tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ape tolimok Daudi eketiyan kaŋ atemar ebala Ekapolon, ‘Meere iyoŋ idukokini Akai ŋina ayakaun ayoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameun akoloŋit ŋina ayaunia ayoŋ Ŋisirael alo Ijipit, nyeyakauna ayoŋ Kai tari nakoloŋit na. Arae ca loeema ayai ayoŋ, akisyakin anakibois ka apei a ŋina ipotu iyes toloma tari ŋinace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anakiboisyo a daadaŋ a ŋuna abu ayoŋ orukosi ka Ŋisirael daadaŋ, abu mono ayoŋ eŋit edio a ŋikatubok kec a ŋulu abu ayoŋ ecik akiyok ŋituŋa kaŋ Ŋisirael atemar anukiro nyikidukokinitotor iyes ayoŋ Akai a ŋakito a Cedar a?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun nai, tolimok Daudi eketiyan kaŋ atemar ebala Ekapolon ŋolo a ŋajoresyo ebe, ‘Abu ayoŋ okolemu iyoŋ anacokor, anakiyok ŋamesekin aŋuna ka aruwor ekepukan a ŋituŋa kaŋ a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukitoe iwon ŋinapei aneni daadaŋ ibu iyoŋ tolot, ido amunya ayoŋ ŋimoe kon daadaŋ ŋulu eriwokina kiŋaren kon. Eturuwori ayoŋ ekiro kon ŋolo eyenen nooi, kikwaanikin ka ŋirorwa a ŋarwonita anakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseuni ayoŋ akibois a ŋituŋa kaŋ a Ŋisirael, ido esiboik ikes nen, ikotere ikes eryamunete akibois ŋina erae ŋina kec,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Nabo daŋ, akalimokini ayoŋ iyoŋ atemar akainakini ayoŋ iyoŋ ŋiletok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edaun ŋirwa kon anakwap a na, apaki ŋina ikinukere iyoŋ neni enukitae atapapaa kon, etopoloori ayoŋ eletonit, kon kilunyokin lokicoloŋ kon, eletonit ŋolo erae iyoŋ elope iuruunit, ido etogogoŋi ayoŋ apukan keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eletonit ŋol iŋes edukokini Akai aŋuna a ekiro kaŋ, ido etogogoŋi ayoŋ ekipukae keŋ torubak ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruwor ayoŋ papa keŋ, ido eruwor iŋes lokoku kaŋ. Nyajoŋoe ayoŋ amina iŋes lopite ŋolo abunio ojoŋoo amina ekepukan ŋolo ibu iyoŋ kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainakini ayoŋ iŋes apolokin ŋituŋa kaŋ, ido oinak iŋes apukan kaŋ kipuka ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Nasan Daudi ŋakiro ŋun daadaŋ ŋuna esileerekinit Ekapolon iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akilip a Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloma nai erwosit Daudi loeema, kiboikin nen kiŋit Ekapolon ilipi tema, “Ŋae ayoŋ okoe Ekapolon Akuj, ata ŋae ŋituŋa a ekal kaŋ itiyaa iyoŋ ŋakiro ŋuna ajokak ŋun daadaŋ neni kaŋ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meere ŋun bon isileereu iyoŋ okoe Ekapolon Akuj, ilimu iyoŋ tari ŋuna itiyakini lotuŋa a ekal a eketiyan kon alorwa a ŋulu epote. Ikitusubunit iyoŋ ayoŋ ituŋanan ŋini apol nooi, okoe Ekapolon Akuj! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anukiro tokona ŋace ŋuna apedori ayoŋ alimokin iyoŋ aŋuna ikitopoloorya iyoŋ ayoŋ eketiyan kon? Ikiyeni iyoŋ ayoŋ eketiyan kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoe Ekapolon. Aŋuna ke eketiyan kon ka aŋuna ka acamit a etau kon, itiya iyoŋ ŋakiro ŋuna apolok nooi ŋun daadaŋ, ikiteyenik iyoŋ ayoŋ ŋakiro ŋuna apolok nooi ŋun daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emam ŋini epol ikwa iyoŋ, okoe Ekapolon, emam Akuj ace mati iyoŋ bon ikwapei eirarere isua ŋakiro daadaŋ a ŋaki kosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ata ŋae ŋituŋa ikwaan ka ŋituŋa kon Ŋisirael? Eya mono ŋituŋa ŋice ikwaanatar ikes anakwapin a akwap ŋulu abu Akuj kec tolot alakun toruworos ŋituŋa keŋ, ido toruunio ekiro keŋ aloticisyo keŋ a ŋulu apolok ka a ŋulu ka aumokin a? Eya mono ŋituŋa ŋulu abu Akuj kitiya ŋuna ka aumokin neni kec anakiritanar ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin alokiŋaren ŋituŋa kon ŋulu ibu iyoŋ tolaku alo Ijipit a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituruwo iyoŋ Ŋisirael kire jik ŋituŋa kon a alope ŋikaru ka ŋikaru, idau iyoŋ aruwor Akuj kec okoe Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tokona Ekapolon, alotooma ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna idau iyoŋ akisileereun aŋuna a eketiyan kon ka aŋuna a ŋituŋa a ekal keŋ, kisiyook toruwor ŋuna a ŋikaru ka ŋikaru; kitiya lopite ŋolo idaunia iyoŋ akiikin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikotere nai itopolooryo ekiro kon ŋikaru ka ŋikaru anakiro a ŋuna ebasi, ‘Erae Ekapolon ŋolo a ŋajoresyo, Akuj ŋina ipukat Isirael, ŋina erae Akuj a Isirael ka erubakinete ŋiletok a Daudi a eketiyan kon erae ŋikepukak ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuj kaŋ, ikisileerek iyoŋ ayoŋ eketiyan kon atemar ŋiletok kaŋ ituruwori iyoŋ ŋirwosi. Aŋun, adau ayoŋ eketiyan kon aryamun akisimukekinet ŋinakilipet neni kon anakilip a na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoe Ekapolon, irae iyoŋ Akuj, idau iyoŋ akiikin ayoŋ eketiyan kon ŋakiro ŋun ŋuna ajokak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elipi tolakar iyoŋ kiterereŋ ekal a eketiyan kon, ikotere erubakinete erae ŋulu kon, anerae iyoŋ okoe Ekapolon, idau akiterereŋ ikes ka erereŋioto ikes ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.”",
          "type": "text",
